117	     * of time; the terms recorded from other dates are kept), and set their tags from the comma separated
118	     * text (null: kept as they are). PERSON_EDITED carries the terms in force on the sheet's today.
119	     */
120	    @Transactional
121	    public Person edit(String sheetId, String user, long personId, long version, String name, String grade,
122	            LocalDate gradeFrom, Integer terms, LocalDate termsFrom, String contact, boolean termsGiven,
123	            boolean contactGiven, String tags) {
